      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Before we begin</p>
        <h2 class="h2">A free consult to see if it's a fit.</h2>
        <p class="lede">We'll talk about your practice, who you want to work with and what you've already tried. If I think I can help, I'll tell you what I'd look at first. If I don't, I'll say so and point you somewhere useful.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step">
          <h3 class="h3">Practice Growth Audit &amp; Roadmap</h3>
          <p>I look at your market the way a potential client does, from search results and directories to the doctors and schools who might send people your way. Then I map where your current clients actually come from.</p>
          <ul class="ticks small" style="margin-top:8px">
            <li>Market research on how clients find therapists near you</li>
            <li>A map of your current and missing acquisition channels</li>
            <li>A branded strategy deck with priorities, in order</li>
            <li>A walkthrough call to go over it together</li>
          </ul>
          <span style="margin-top:8px"><span class="tag">Start here</span></span>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <h3 class="h3">Implementation tracks</h3>
          <p>You pick the tracks from the roadmap you want to take on now. Each one has a defined scope and a clear finish line, so you can add another later without starting over.</p>
          <ul class="ticks small" style="margin-top:8px">
            <li>Referral Partner Development</li>
            <li>Directory &amp; Listings Management</li>
            <li>Search Visibility: SEO + AI Search</li>
            <li>Paid Advertising</li>
            <li>Social Media &amp; Content Strategy</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <h3 class="h3">Monthly retainer, if you want one</h3>
          <p>Referral relationships need tending, and listings drift out of date. A retainer keeps a steady cadence going so the work doesn't fade once the initial push is done.</p>
          <ul class="ticks small" style="margin-top:8px">
            <li>Ongoing referral partner outreach and follow-up</li>
            <li>Listing and profile upkeep</li>
            <li>A monthly check-in on what's working</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>
